            "review_title": "Review at Khrua Baan Thai 37 Bát Đàn",
            "review_text": "Anh N\nHanoi, Vietnam11 contributions\n0\nGreat Laeng Saeb and Shrimp Salad, So-So Hot Pot\nMay 2025 • Friends\nMy experience here was relatively good.\nThe restaurant was clean, the atmosphere was cool and not too noisy. Service was decent, above average. Some of the Thai dishes like Ribs Tower (Laeng Saeb) and the raw shrimp salad were really tasty. However, the hot pot didn’t stand out much.\nThere’s no parking space available, so we had to leave the car at a paid lot nearby.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nGreat Laeng Saeb\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 16, 2025",
