            "review_title": "Review at Khrua Baan Thai 37 Bát Đàn",
            "review_text": "MUBUTU\nBournemouth, United Kingdom50 contributions\n0\nGreat food, we will go again on this trip.\nDec 2023 • Friends\nWe ate here last night and the food was superb and the restaurant very clean. The serving team were very helpful and polite. \n\nWe had the crispy beef with sticky rice, the stem broccoli, mixed chicken rice, straw mushrooms and the pork cheek. It was all very well presented and tasted really good.\n\nWe will go here again I am sure.\nRead more\nWritten December 13, 2023",
